# Requirements - AI Task Manager 

## 1. Functional Requirements 
- FR1: Users are able to add tasks with a due date and description.
- FR2: User can view, edit, delete, and check off tasks as done
- FR3: System can assign a priority score 
- FR4: Based off usage, system recommends productivity improvements 
    or points out more productive time of day 

